    I've played around with making a basic
    GTA 5 Script Hook V mod with C#.
    <br>
    I have messed with C++ quite a bit, and have made some mods <br>
    for GTA 5, San Andreas and some other Grand Theft Auto games using it.
    <br>

  </p>

  {/* I didn't know I could make code block tags */}
  <br />
  <Code code={javaScriptCode1} lang="ts" />
  <!--<Code code="console.log('Hello world!')" lang="js" />-->

  <!--<Code code={CPPHelloWorld} lang="cpp" />-->
</BaseLayout>
